  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 5.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.86,
      "end_seconds": 10.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.21,
      "end_seconds": 18.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "doctor, it's a pearly bump on my nose that bleeds it's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.29,
      "end_seconds": 20.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.47,
      "end_seconds": 29.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah. I've had a sore that won't heal too, for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.57,
      "end_seconds": 40.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.23,
      "end_seconds": 44.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "It's furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.31,
      "end_seconds": 48.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.81,
      "end_seconds": 57.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "For nearly five years. I'm on Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.6,
      "end_seconds": 71.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.99,
      "end_seconds": 80.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "I mean, I had a cataract operation in my left eye about a year ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.86,
      "end_seconds": 84.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.47,
      "end_seconds": 88.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.04,
      "end_seconds": 93.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.13,
      "end_seconds": 111.67,
      "duration_seconds": 17.54,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.25,
      "end_seconds": 118.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.5,
      "end_seconds": 122.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.59,
      "end_seconds": 124.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.46,
      "end_seconds": 132.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "yes, heart failure i've had COPD for nearly five years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.9,
      "end_seconds": 141.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Alright, heart disease and COPD, that matches what I have here. And And other new lumps, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.12,
      "end_seconds": 146.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "not that I've noticed, no other new lumps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.04,
      "end_seconds": 158.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pain, family history of skin cancer or swollen glands?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.3,
      "end_seconds": 165.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "no pain, family history of skin cancer or swollen glands, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.64,
      "end_seconds": 171.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "alright, any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.97,
      "end_seconds": 178.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.12,
      "end_seconds": 180.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.63,
      "end_seconds": 183.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.0,
      "end_seconds": 188.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.17,
      "end_seconds": 203.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.36,
      "end_seconds": 220.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 126 over 80, temp 36.7 degrees, pulse 74, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.55,
      "end_seconds": 224.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Is that that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.89,
      "end_seconds": 228.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.19,
      "end_seconds": 234.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.85,
      "end_seconds": 237.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "breathe out slowly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.15,
      "end_seconds": 258.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "there is a pearly nodule with fine surface vessels and a central dip on the side of the nose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.62,
      "end_seconds": 267.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.09,
      "end_seconds": 291.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is a likely basal cell carcinoma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.16,
      "end_seconds": 294.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.98,
      "end_seconds": 323.28,
      "duration_seconds": 28.3,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a likely basal cell carcinoma is my leading thought, not anything worse i'm sending you for a dermoscopy because of suspicious lesion i'm going to order a skin biopsy, for suspicious lesion please use a high-factor sunscreen and a hat i'd like you to see the skin cancer clinic as well, and I'll write the referral"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.89,
      "end_seconds": 333.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.14,
      "end_seconds": 337.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.66,
      "end_seconds": 347.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "I'd like you back after the biopsy. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.18,
      "end_seconds": 350.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}